{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02370","headline":"杂歌谣辞 箜篌谣 · 李白","name":"杂歌谣辞 箜篌谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"攀天莫登龙，走山莫骑虎。\n贵贱结交心不移，唯有严陵及光武。\n周公称大圣，管蔡宁相容。\n汉谣一斗粟，不与淮南舂。\n兄弟尚路人，吾心安所从。\n它人方寸间，山海几千重。\n轻言托朋友，对面九疑峰。\n多花必早落，桃李不如松。\n管鲍久已死，何人继其踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}